{
  "name": "AI-written social media post with Slack approval, published by Ampost",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI-written post with approval\n### How it works\nEvery Monday OpenAI writes a post on your topic. Ampost saves it as a draft (you can also edit it in Ampost), Slack asks you to approve it, and Ampost publishes or deletes it.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-ampost** (tested with 0.1.1): Settings → Community nodes → Install, as in the [n8n guide](https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/community-nodes/installation/). Until n8n verifies it, the node needs self-hosted n8n.\n2. Create an Ampost credential with an API key from [ampost.io](https://ampost.io/?ref=n8n) → Setup → API keys.\n3. Add OpenAI and Slack credentials, and pick the channel in **Ask for approval**.\n4. Set the topic and platforms in **Topic**.\n5. Activate the workflow.\n\nPrefer email? Swap the Slack node for Gmail → Send and wait for response.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "0072a877-dda5-4170-a954-3b65199b57ef",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "748d271a-d349-47df-a6fd-70ab77f267b7",
      "name": "Every Monday",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "2ee371c3-8820-4ad4-a479-67b8185ad7fb",
              "name": "topic",
              "value": "One practical tip for small teams that post on social media",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "953ff609-c811-4785-ab21-f3a1cbde77ae",
              "name": "platforms",
              "value": "bluesky,threads",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f9439c3d-1fee-4e64-acaa-b533fbd48a71",
      "name": "Topic",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4.1-mini",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "GPT-4.1-MINI"
        },
        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Write a post about: {{ $json.topic }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "instructions": "You write social media posts. Plain text, no hashtags, no emojis, at most 280 characters. Answer with the post only."
        }
      },
      "id": "5b2ebae3-12aa-4799-ad1a-3bb6addb28a0",
      "name": "Write the post",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "openAiCredential",
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "platforms": "={{ $('Topic').item.json.platforms.split(',').map(p => p.trim()) }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.output[0].content[0].text.trim() }}",
        "publishMode": "draft",
        "additionalFields": {},
        "platformOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "7d32b717-4a7a-4d40-a2a0-ce65a07899c4",
      "name": "Save as draft",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ampost.ampost",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "ampostApi": {
          "id": "ampostApiCredential",
          "name": "Ampost account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendAndWait",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "message": "=New post for {{ $json.platforms.join(', ') }}:\n\n{{ $json.text }}",
        "approvalOptions": {
          "values": {
            "approvalType": "double"
          }
        },
        "options": {
          "limitWaitTime": {
            "values": {
              "resumeAmount": 2,
              "resumeUnit": "days"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "2d3d6557-4ca6-4dd4-aa4d-fbd9f06782f9",
      "name": "Ask for approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "slackCredential",
          "name": "Slack account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "51f2fbb1-39e6-481b-aec7-2eed76674ed6",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.data.approved }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ca0e87c1-b7c3-4a10-a770-691c15d81255",
      "name": "Approved?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "publish",
        "postId": "={{ $('Save as draft').item.json.id }}",
        "idempotencyKey": "=approve-{{ $('Save as draft').item.json.id }}"
      },
      "id": "576827c9-3ae3-4e87-a746-1f0c94e51f0e",
      "name": "Publish",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ampost.ampost",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1680,
        -100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "ampostApi": {
          "id": "ampostApiCredential",
          "name": "Ampost account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "delete",
        "postId": "={{ $('Save as draft').item.json.id }}"
      },
      "id": "c8fd5835-099b-4427-ab7e-ff9fc99bd9cb",
      "name": "Delete the draft",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ampost.ampost",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1680,
        100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "ampostApi": {
          "id": "ampostApiCredential",
          "name": "Ampost account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Write the post\nEvery Monday the topic goes to OpenAI, which writes the post text.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "e16d4676-2ee4-4758-a7f5-36f475de4ef0",
      "name": "Section: Write the post",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Ask for approval\nAmpost saves the post as a draft, and Slack waits for your answer.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "345a7488-3fa3-40c3-ad2b-251556e3565c",
      "name": "Section: Ask for approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Publish or delete\nApproved drafts are published at once; rejected drafts are deleted.",
        "height": 540,
        "width": 220,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c3d8c5ea-5ac2-4479-a2fd-fa509c9447a0",
      "name": "Section: Publish or delete",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1620,
        -300
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every Monday": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Topic",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Topic": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Write the post",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Write the post": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Save as draft",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Save as draft": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Ask for approval",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Ask for approval": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Approved?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Approved?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Publish",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Delete the draft",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}
